{
  "_comment": "Steward 宿主 hook 配置示例（P2）：挂载所有权/危险命令/密钥三道守卫。ZCode 插件级 hooks 的字段口径以宿主版本为准；若插件级挂载不可用，把本文件内容合并进用户/工作区 settings 的 hooks 配置，guard 路径指向已安装插件内的 scripts/hooks/guard.mjs。守卫 fail-open：解析失败不阻塞。",
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Write|Edit",
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "node \"<STEWARD_PLUGIN>/zcode/scripts/hooks/guard.mjs\" secret" },
          { "type": "command", "command": "node \"<STEWARD_PLUGIN>/zcode/scripts/hooks/guard.mjs\" ownership" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "node \"<STEWARD_PLUGIN>/zcode/scripts/hooks/guard.mjs\" dangerous" }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
